      "sentence_id": 14,
      "text": "The respondents herein were prosecuted in S.T.C.No.630 of 2007 on the file of the learned Judicial Magistrate No.4, Tirunelveli, for the offence under Sections 7(ii), 16(1) (a) (i) r/w 2(ix) (k) of the Prevention of Food Adulteration Act 1954 and Section 32(f) of the Prevention of Food Adulteration Act 1955.",
