      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.12819819152355194
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 16,
      "text": "Questioning the same, this Criminal Appeal has been filed by the defacto complainant.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1499,
      "end": 1585,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.15467821061611176
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 17,
      "text": "2. After hearing the learned Government Advocate(Crl. Side) appearing for the appellant and going through the records, this Court is of the view that no interference is called for.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 1587,
      "end": 1767,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 18,
      "text": "The learned trial Magistrate in paragraph No.13 of the Judgment has given a strong and convincing reasons for acquitting the accused.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 1768,
      "end": 1901,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.16393934190273285
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 19,
      "text": "This is the case of misbranding.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 1902,
      "end": 1934,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2065095454454422
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 20,
      "text": "3. According to the complainant, ingredients have not been stated in the label of the packet concerned.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 1935,
      "end": 2039,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.1456773579120636
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 21,
      "text": "But then, when the quantity contains below 20 grams, there is no need to mention http://www.judis.nic.in the ingredients.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 2040,
      "end": 2161,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.12732301652431488
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 22,
      "text": "It has been further found by the trial Court that all the other relevant details are very much found in the packets in question.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 2162,
      "end": 2290,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.1337430626153946
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 23,
      "text": "Therefore, I am of the view that no interference is called for.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 2291,
      "end": 2354,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.1594255268573761
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 24,
      "text": "4. The Criminal appeal stands dismissed, accordingly.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 2355,
      "end": 2409,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "decision",
